# Ready-made requests for the API. Works in Visual Studio, Rider and VS Code (REST Client extension).
# Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/MarketTimeSeries.Api
# Run the requests from top to bottom. After request 3, copy the "id" from its response into @id.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@series = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/time-series
@id = paste-the-id-from-request-3

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Search SE3: today's seed data, including the DK1 to SE3 flow (SE3 is its "to" zone); without a window, no points
GET {{series}}?biddingZone=SE3

### 3. Create a flow from SE3 to FI: 201 Created with Location and ETag "1"
POST {{series}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "SE3",
  "toBiddingZone": "FI",
  "unit": "MW",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "values": [820.5, 815.0, 798.2, 801.7, 760.0, -120.0, -95.5, 640.3]
}

### 4. Get it by id: 200 with calculated points and ETag "1"
GET {{series}}/{{id}}

### 5. Search with a window: only the points from 00:30 up to (not including) 01:30 are returned
GET {{series}}?biddingZone=FI&from=2026-12-01T00:30:00Z&to=2026-12-01T01:30:00Z

### 6. Create an overlapping flow on the same border: 409 Conflict
POST {{series}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "SE3",
  "toBiddingZone": "FI",
  "unit": "MW",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-12-01T01:00:00Z",
  "values": [700.0]
}

### 7. Break two rules (start not aligned, flow without a "to" zone): 400 with an error per field
POST {{series}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "SE3",
  "unit": "MW",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-12-01T00:07:00Z",
  "values": [700.0]
}

### 8. Replace it with If-Match "1": 200 with version 2 and ETag "2"
PUT {{series}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "SE3",
  "toBiddingZone": "FI",
  "unit": "MW",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "values": [830.0, 825.5, 810.0, 805.2]
}

### 9. Send the same request again: the version is now 2, so If-Match "1" is stale: 412 Precondition Failed
PUT {{series}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "SE3",
  "toBiddingZone": "FI",
  "unit": "MW",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "values": [999.0]
}

### 10. Delete it: 204 No Content
DELETE {{series}}/{{id}}

### 11. Get it again: 404 Not Found
GET {{series}}/{{id}}
